{"id":"steam-1063180","steam":1063180,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Flowerless Gardenia 白花未咲","summary":"The protagonist Shirosaki Hyou was originally a killer, but everything changed after she met a weird man.","about":"Story\n\r\nThe two hands that are tightly held are gradually cold,\r\nThe white flower finally bloomed at this moment.\r\nStill, I still met you,\r\nThe fragmented world has become beautiful.\r\nIf you can feel this happiness,\r\nEven if the heartbeat stops,\r\nEven if it is highly toxic,\r\nCan not hinder this oath.\r\nBreathing is weak,\r\nBright red gradually spread,\r\nLet the rain wash away all my lies,\r\nThen, say goodbye to this ugly world.\r\n\r\n\nFeatures\n\r\nThe game's gameplay is close to AVG. It is based on the plot with a single ending. What's more is a collection system.  According to the complete collection of items, the ending will be unlocked after the day. If the player completes all collections,  the game will have a hidden plot at the end of the story.\r\n\r\n\nOther\n\r\nThis story is containing Yuri-love.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063180/library_600x900.jpg?t=1787005635","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063180/header.jpg?t=1787005635","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063180/library_hero.jpg?t=1787005635","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063180/header.jpg?t=1787005635","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063180/ss_c812bbd7645de60e075808a162c23c2596f910c8.600x338.jpg?t=1787005635","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063180/ss_c812bbd7645de60e075808a162c23c2596f910c8.jpg?t=1787005635"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063180/ss_96d853c88ad7eb76207a5a414096d979193b5189.600x338